==French==

===Etymology===
From {{m|la|*postius}}, a {{etyl|VL.|fr}} comparative of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|post}}.<ref>{{cite-book|last=Picoche|first=Jacqueline|coauthors=Jean-Claude Rolland|title=Dictionnaire étymologique du français|year=2009|publisher=Dictionnaires Le Robert|location=Paris|language=French|pages=|chapter=}}</ref> Compare Portuguese {{m|pt|pois}}, Spanish {{m|es|pues}}, Italian {{m|it|poi}}.

